SUMMARY:20's & 30's Phantoms by Firelight
LOCATION:1 Old Sturbridge Village Rd\nSturbridge\, MA 01566
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 24\, 2026 | 4:00 PM\nhttps://activities.out
 doors.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001LBO52AO/\nJoin the Worcester 20's & 30'
 s at Phantoms by Firelight: a Mary Shelley's Frankenstein themed event at 
 Old Sturbridge Village. This is an interactive experience where we will ex
 plore a 1830's colonial village transformed for Halloween. The event runs
  from 4:30 PM to 9:00 PM. We will meet in the parking lot before going int
 o the gate and then be free to break up into smaller groups. We will also 
 set an optional meet up time for dinner. Participants are responsible for
  purchasing their own tickets ($36 as of 10/14). The event is rain or shin
 e. For more information about Phantoms by Firelight please see the OSV we
 bsite: https://www.osv.org/event/phantoms-by-firelight/
END:VEVENT
