SUMMARY:Sunrike up 'Chussey! (Optional social after)
LOCATION:Mountain R\nPrinceton\, MA 01541
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, November 1\, 2026 | 4:45 AM\nhttps://activities.outdo
 ors.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001LL452AG/\nJoin us for a sunrise hike (Sun
 rike) up Mt. Wachusett (`Chussey)! We will hike 3-4 miles with a total ele
 vation gain of about 750 ft. We plan to spend some time at the summit to e
 njoy the sunrise\, then return to the trailhead near Mountainside Cafe. Fe
 el free to stay for an optional coffee or treat after the hike.The trails 
 will include sections of moderate terrain\, and we will be moving at a mod
 erate pace.Proper equipment will be required for this hike\, including hik
 ing and weather-appropriate clothing\, water\, and a headlamp.Please note 
 that this hike will occur the day that Daylight Saving Time ends. Because 
 the time "falls forward\," The 4:45 am start time will feel like 5:45 am t
 o your internal clock. Be careful when setting your alarms so you don't sh
 ow up an hour early!
